    "title": "GATEWAY-batchinsertion-List Weather Alerts Regions-v4-spec",
    "description": "The Weather Alerts Regions API enables users to access comprehensive information about specific geographical regions concerning weather alerts. This endpoint allows consumers to retrieve lists of regions affected by weather alerts, facilitating timely response and decision-making for emergency management, public safety officials, and local governments. Typical use cases include monitoring severe weather updates and coordinating disaster response efforts. By providing detailed alert information at the regional level, this API empowers users to stay informed and proactive in safeguarding their communities.",
